  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Well, have you heard the news?\"",
      "output_sha256": "f6711bce540cbd380c6be99e0914231ec1e89e0e357cc1d9042dc89b0d1f4e44",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "f6711bce540cbd380c6be99e0914231ec1e89e0e357cc1d9042dc89b0d1f4e44",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It was the landlord of the Blue Boar who interrupted me as I walked down the village lane, a meandering path lined with a handful of thatched cottages and several barns.",
      "output_sha256": "d074550a4989744498bbc76cbc400f7adb81cff19a67db22e6f03c5d809a223d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.482019,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2,
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "63638d6e5b96574d983b72ddde3ab323d92aa0453c69bf4111533189b6a7d5bf",
        "39ee99f91c15a90b238a0f62a290feef6590fb3889e9b0e55aa562776fd1bbeb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d074550a4989744498bbc76cbc400f7adb81cff19a67db22e6f03c5d809a223d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2,
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "His face radiated excitement, and it was clear he had some significant news to share.",
      "output_sha256": "e204e7c580fd97122668b5eff1c487348981436108b422b779e8faf109b0bd83",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.482019,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2,
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "63638d6e5b96574d983b72ddde3ab323d92aa0453c69bf4111533189b6a7d5bf",
        "39ee99f91c15a90b238a0f62a290feef6590fb3889e9b0e55aa562776fd1bbeb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e204e7c580fd97122668b5eff1c487348981436108b422b779e8faf109b0bd83",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2,
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He is an old soldier himself, and his views on the war are held in great esteem.",
      "output_sha256": "5749591da20e8ad39bfb0a4c550678bac04c97a6c31256a2745d803efcffdccd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "5749591da20e8ad39bfb0a4c550678bac04c97a6c31256a2745d803efcffdccd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I hadn’t yet caught wind of the news, but the landlord’s broad grin assured me it was something positive.",
      "output_sha256": "b54d04522411b56f1abdf524befe77c152615700dd35424765e2a5d853342e1d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.333075,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "114c7d96592c0e5f66cfe39fa0b1fdec3259ed6fb712636a92325e1bdc7de2f7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b54d04522411b56f1abdf524befe77c152615700dd35424765e2a5d853342e1d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“Jim has received a commission,” he announced, his tone unmistakably conveying that this development would set events in motion.",
      "output_sha256": "c9a5b6ac42afb61a0d44913ceb30ca97dd071213f31317ab4f57e60ec2b7d673",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.370699,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "05b780bf50ff1c07ef302f28aecd53a585abad5d59990ada8c2688f99d9d6f91"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c9a5b6ac42afb61a0d44913ceb30ca97dd071213f31317ab4f57e60ec2b7d673",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For Jim is his son, a sergeant-major in the artillery, who has been out at the front ever since Mons.",
      "output_sha256": "a562bcc16b2868a2ce69886c92224b99df67b66614dd9302badc208bdf7c5e49",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "a562bcc16b2868a2ce69886c92224b99df67b66614dd9302badc208bdf7c5e49",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The news has created quite a sensation.",
      "output_sha256": "b4cc2adbf6e38641cff0293a202b67dea9ca792408f40db7004d00daa52d8b03",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "b4cc2adbf6e38641cff0293a202b67dea9ca792408f40db7004d00daa52d8b03",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But we are getting so used to sensations now that we are becoming blasé .",
      "output_sha256": "97348ba29830f24565d731281f2412cd43890a63d59dce002078053f1b1c8511",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "97348ba29830f24565d731281f2412cd43890a63d59dce002078053f1b1c8511",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There has never been such a year of wonders in the memory of any one living.",
      "output_sha256": "7acbc0f36e0f97e1fffe9d13cf5ac68188579021021dc6c0709d47a134067c52",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "7acbc0f36e0f97e1fffe9d13cf5ac68188579021021dc6c0709d47a134067c52",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The other day thousands of soldiers from the great camp ten miles away descended on our \"terrain\"—I think that's the word—and had a tremendous two-days' battle in the hills about us.",
      "output_sha256": "af111db7c057efe27898ee7d99b456d2b64f5c57a9e217e0aefde4ef580a23a2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "af111db7c057efe27898ee7d99b456d2b64f5c57a9e217e0aefde4ef580a23a2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They broke through the hedges, and slept in the cornfields, and ravished the apple-trees in my orchard, and raided the cottagers for tea, and tramped to and fro in our street and gave us the time of our lives.",
      "output_sha256": "95477205b9273eb908757e051e0835d0e6f5f2d5d6803076546fd863f737df65",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "95477205b9273eb908757e051e0835d0e6f5f2d5d6803076546fd863f737df65",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\" I never seed such a sight in my life,\" said old Benjamin to me in the evening.",
      "output_sha256": "5c2a262b2f4178e19e81a3361b2493528cf3af6e42b797ea833d0bfe8945175e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "5c2a262b2f4178e19e81a3361b2493528cf3af6e42b797ea833d0bfe8945175e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Man and boy, I've lived in that there bungalow for eighty-five year come Michaelmas, and I never seed the like o' this before….",
      "output_sha256": "cce5362f72e869b8213128fd8c823c387142add3abaf1dc7de40535686b00ad6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "cce5362f72e869b8213128fd8c823c387142add3abaf1dc7de40535686b00ad6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yes, eighty-five years come Michaelmas.",
      "output_sha256": "20bbd0159d61f5b4a1d4845a29baa71293a3a3bcb67f46f8f080b6c4cffca365",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.81,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2c751ad1689f5fa0e4bca3934f43cd12d9cf8288443241b2ab04ad5bb2b3384d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "20bbd0159d61f5b4a1d4845a29baa71293a3a3bcb67f46f8f080b6c4cffca365",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "My father had that land on a peppercorn rent, and the way he lost it was like this—”",
      "output_sha256": "7a5a9629c36af5bb03debf3778c1a417e9f4e0c1f19fdcc40ebb2e97bf910b03",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.906316,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "374589d4da0ee8756678d909afb00138f6bff1f785f4f0868fd2e1513488335b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7a5a9629c36af5bb03debf3778c1a417e9f4e0c1f19fdcc40ebb2e97bf910b03",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Happily at this moment there was a sudden alarum among the soldiers, and I was able to dodge the familiar rehearsal of old Benjamin's grievance.",
      "output_sha256": "c538dce05bd2c11055c0cd0126f4efe94f37bdceabafa48f3a9ce47550d2d4a6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "c538dce05bd2c11055c0cd0126f4efe94f37bdceabafa48f3a9ce47550d2d4a6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And who would ever have dreamed that we should live to hear French talked in our street as a familiar form of speech?",
      "output_sha256": "6e4185b12f9a7a95cf7d90a5661da464a1ebcc3bdca719622f4502b9076752b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "6e4185b12f9a7a95cf7d90a5661da464a1ebcc3bdca719622f4502b9076752b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But we have.",
      "output_sha256": "27b3a90d2774e77ce562c9df80873560f57b180997cd7fc86235ede308645c8c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "27b3a90d2774e77ce562c9df80873560f57b180997cd7fc86235ede308645c8c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In a little cottage at the other end of the village is a family of Belgians, a fragment of the flotsam thrown up by the great inundation of 1914.",
      "output_sha256": "3a1c8f321a5931ebe0e128c7aa2c04002d406abcf433e5b77f34d2bdded9c1fa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "3a1c8f321a5931ebe0e128c7aa2c04002d406abcf433e5b77f34d2bdded9c1fa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Their experiences have brought the harsh realities of war uncomfortably close, having fled the horrors of Louvain, where they hid in cellars for days while two of their children lost their lives, ultimately escaping to the coast on foot.",
      "output_sha256": "396f3079fb492615831d38f8a04af21b74ab0bba570acf6ecbad588397cd867a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.54721,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5db31cbf187ee17da6fdc4b9e324a2289f8f8c3233b1c331ee5e5e757b0ac362"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "396f3079fb492615831d38f8a04af21b74ab0bba570acf6ecbad588397cd867a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Every Sunday night you will see them very busy carrying their few chairs and tables into a neighbouring barn, for on Monday mornings mass is celebrated there.",
      "output_sha256": "1d9360146d3e11ea38053a726f252db7b9295f461c01c5875d51b4a1755548d9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "1d9360146d3e11ea38053a726f252db7b9295f461c01c5875d51b4a1755548d9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "A priest travels ten miles in a country cart to lead the service, gathering refugees from the surrounding area for worship.",
      "output_sha256": "55d3123b4ad228ef300f211ee448dd46a8a51b0c5fae9b2315c9259b56890030",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.535737,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "058d2db0f46023f80f956644719111de89cec535dbc7bfc99ea6d32bddc38c19"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "55d3123b4ad228ef300f211ee448dd46a8a51b0c5fae9b2315c9259b56890030",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22,
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "After the mass, there’s a lively exchange in French and Flemish, filled with laughter and joy.",
      "output_sha256": "4a92cb92ca883bc23773e83bea7ed0cbd19c0bc947346ff1010aad64710ff4c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.535737,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "058d2db0f46023f80f956644719111de89cec535dbc7bfc99ea6d32bddc38c19"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4a92cb92ca883bc23773e83bea7ed0cbd19c0bc947346ff1010aad64710ff4c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22,
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Old Benjamin \"don't hold with they priests,\" and he has grave suspicions about all foreign tongues, but the Belgians have become quite a part of us, and their children are learning to lisp in English down at the school in the valley.",
      "output_sha256": "f7a24b5be88c13078e6b750f42713eedc6c894a91856cc0cd5cab5f689bd72df",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "f7a24b5be88c13078e6b750f42713eedc6c894a91856cc0cd5cab5f689bd72df",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Much less agreeable is the frame of mind towards the occupants of the cottage next to the Blue Boar.",
      "output_sha256": "68683001a9028d08d89d0495017edfc976828f9372c1ef377bebd3197c1a4a9d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "68683001a9028d08d89d0495017edfc976828f9372c1ef377bebd3197c1a4a9d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They are the wife and children of a German who had worked in this country for many years and is now in America.",
      "output_sha256": "2329b640ff7497857b3820baf7684ad2d69c12e81f86f21b59d1f988664a04c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "2329b640ff7497857b3820baf7684ad2d69c12e81f86f21b59d1f988664a04c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The woman is English and amiable, but the proximity of anything so reminiscent of Germany is painful to the village, and especially to the landlord, whose views about Germans can hardly be put into words.",
      "output_sha256": "195d7cd4a814cb7a0c4881656039d1612f839c5aef3c8b47d42b71ec45ad916e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "195d7cd4a814cb7a0c4881656039d1612f839c5aef3c8b47d42b71ec45ad916e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"I should hope there'll be no prisoners took after this ,\" he says grimly whenever he hears of a new outrage.",
      "output_sha256": "b7169bcb381d13d01f7c3e3555bd3137ddc1123cfd1fa9147d2f5c3b4f1bc8e5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "b7169bcb381d13d01f7c3e3555bd3137ddc1123cfd1fa9147d2f5c3b4f1bc8e5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Vermin—that's what they are,\" he says, \"and they should be treated according-ly.\"",
      "output_sha256": "871211544cd5a08089dffd6c570cc14f29a5b7aa949e7bec6e03e3e517ff4472",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "871211544cd5a08089dffd6c570cc14f29a5b7aa949e7bec6e03e3e517ff4472",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The Germans, in fact, have become the substitute for every term of execration, even with mild David the labourer.",
      "output_sha256": "5abd183c170e78e850c7a43ddd5439866ce9abdf75f43a8d0a1f11a51d39fa0f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "5abd183c170e78e850c7a43ddd5439866ce9abdf75f43a8d0a1f11a51d39fa0f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He came into my orchard one evening, struggling under the weight of a fifteen-foot ladder.",
      "output_sha256": "601e1c61bb981b0daf91679e9b5f6d55d6bde61e72a793f962b224efce64d24b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.523462,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d9ca5dc22fed01112a771f14d45056e63f0e5a347c2232c6d6bb264d0bfae6e2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "601e1c61bb981b0daf91679e9b5f6d55d6bde61e72a793f962b224efce64d24b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We had decided that if we were going to have the pears before the wasps had spoiled them we must pick them at once.",
      "output_sha256": "1d83cb851411c6e78bab9a906aff154c87130f41d67e6f68f423472fc8fc8276",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "1d83cb851411c6e78bab9a906aff154c87130f41d67e6f68f423472fc8fc8276",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"It's a wunnerful crop,\" said David.",
      "output_sha256": "20b264e3eec1d607f722410524e14db0de758feda285655eb905296c45f3afcc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "20b264e3eec1d607f722410524e14db0de758feda285655eb905296c45f3afcc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“I’ve known this pear tree for twenty-five years, and I’ve never seen it yield this much before.”",
      "output_sha256": "48052c536610bdb389ae69840d795a01531ff45ba3ed3356c650fc1150d1ec3c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.293328,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cfecaec855b0c24de7fcd135385b0a0c18e53e8322b104167f3a523f7473ab5c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "48052c536610bdb389ae69840d795a01531ff45ba3ed3356c650fc1150d1ec3c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Then he mounted the ladder and began to pick the fruit.",
      "output_sha256": "94146b161235b0eb07816db1a25a3503835aef7cbcdc3b03f0a69b8a3e4a4184",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "94146b161235b0eb07816db1a25a3503835aef7cbcdc3b03f0a69b8a3e4a4184",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“Well, would you look at that!” he exclaimed.",
      "output_sha256": "19701197792218acddc071f4f31354c590232a7b5693acb546b76df2a8a3db4c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.333077,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6c3b0ce8a67a17d1879744f95f59243f1519e6bb9649f2a82984e5bdf7e22f69"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "19701197792218acddc071f4f31354c590232a7b5693acb546b76df2a8a3db4c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38,
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“Those wasps have already been at them.”",
      "output_sha256": "d7f7bc5f70b260fb350af7b7768fcecfd03ed64dcc5e65efb978d2517e08827d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.333077,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6c3b0ce8a67a17d1879744f95f59243f1519e6bb9649f2a82984e5bdf7e22f69"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d7f7bc5f70b260fb350af7b7768fcecfd03ed64dcc5e65efb978d2517e08827d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38,
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And he flung down pear after pear scooped out by the wasps close to the stalk.",
      "output_sha256": "9fc0415245e8ec29417566dc1773d4cb0f6bde9232ea536a2fb0ac4bc41cb379",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "9fc0415245e8ec29417566dc1773d4cb0f6bde9232ea536a2fb0ac4bc41cb379",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Reg'lar Germans—that's what they are,\" he said.",
      "output_sha256": "987d91194ba6b5dd2fd3b7124a8ca21e20ef97a925da50d097d304cd4dddfe40",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "987d91194ba6b5dd2fd3b7124a8ca21e20ef97a925da50d097d304cd4dddfe40",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Look at 'em round that hive,\" he went on.",
      "output_sha256": "b907409504d2c7777b4ae6b77d5f6165ed9bbd44696e0f8b09299de32ca62470",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "b907409504d2c7777b4ae6b77d5f6165ed9bbd44696e0f8b09299de32ca62470",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"They'll hev all the honey and them bees will starve and git the Isle o' Wight—that's what they'll git….",
      "output_sha256": "52042f0142e5be4d7a53ee5313f5ccafecdaa2057386d054deacd720d073ff3b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "52042f0142e5be4d7a53ee5313f5ccafecdaa2057386d054deacd720d073ff3b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "That’s what they’ll get… Honestly, I can’t fathom what wasps and Germans are even for.",
      "output_sha256": "596cdc38085a044f124d78f5793d57c5e88a52de599b6ac3074c094b719cffbb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.360805,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "42f17ebd2f96bcef7f0471fa1645b990e6fd75cad3f9aca7813594a4f2dafeaf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "596cdc38085a044f124d78f5793d57c5e88a52de599b6ac3074c094b719cffbb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It gits over me.\"",
      "output_sha256": "ce0bf0c7edf9096d1c4997aeb0beac216109e6180897730845d3f6d97c5ac195",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "ce0bf0c7edf9096d1c4997aeb0beac216109e6180897730845d3f6d97c5ac195",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I said it got over me too.",
      "output_sha256": "53b91d9642cb12bf07c48f2345896c00ae0ff8f7459208bda1197c5ec8830665",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "53b91d9642cb12bf07c48f2345896c00ae0ff8f7459208bda1197c5ec8830665",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Then, while I held the base of his ladder steady, David opened up about his unease regarding enlisting.",
      "output_sha256": "3570389ef12163a09b770a632c41fd30180bb7a526cb92dd477bfc061518e76c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.407039,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0927662012705f3177677f1b4021dc57a4860fb9dd32aa3788faff57d7843abc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3570389ef12163a09b770a632c41fd30180bb7a526cb92dd477bfc061518e76c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Most o' the chaps round here has gone,\" he said, \"an' I don't like staying be'ind.",
      "output_sha256": "e98cf12da40816bf53a5740261e236a1a7697ad1a4bdd7a4bb8a77c60ef8697c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "e98cf12da40816bf53a5740261e236a1a7697ad1a4bdd7a4bb8a77c60ef8697c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Seems as though you were hanging back like. 'Taint that I shouldn't like to go; but it's this way … (Hullo, I got my hand on a wasp that time) … There's such a lot o' women-folk dependent on me.",
      "output_sha256": "148d3ce5b9c020436220bc91e9a199b908de04f3288b0e9824a98c08f7b1769c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "148d3ce5b9c020436220bc91e9a199b908de04f3288b0e9824a98c08f7b1769c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There's my wife and there's my mother down the village and my aunt; and not a man to do anything for 'em but me.",
      "output_sha256": "2d8c30c42d6bc2eb6ea6e85436f903f1b4fc5c25bce2219489d7f6299536fe42",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "2d8c30c42d6bc2eb6ea6e85436f903f1b4fc5c25bce2219489d7f6299536fe42",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "After my work on th' farm, I keeps all three gardens going and a patch of allotment down the valley as well.\"",
      "output_sha256": "04384d0b9a66a35ae605a1f04ee1fe7a39ad7c128c2b2bea817ccc34674755b6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "04384d0b9a66a35ae605a1f04ee1fe7a39ad7c128c2b2bea817ccc34674755b6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“You’re producing a lot of food, and that’s essential work for the war effort,” I suggested.",
      "output_sha256": "9642dce6e96031985b29589ba5f037a58979ca9ed344c19e3502aef32d1e2a3b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.435991,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d342253a45fd6bc1ec15a25684345cc84beedbaac6b17986aa1d14b9e2ba8978"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9642dce6e96031985b29589ba5f037a58979ca9ed344c19e3502aef32d1e2a3b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He seemed cheered by the idea, and asked me if I'd like to see the potatoes he had dug up that evening—they were \"a wunnerful fine lot,\" he said.",
      "output_sha256": "f390061f2f0df9d686d3e286db60d217b2ef82af382b166f33efa6583a05b9f7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "f390061f2f0df9d686d3e286db60d217b2ef82af382b166f33efa6583a05b9f7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "So after he had stripped the pear-tree he shouldered the ladder, and we went down the village to David's garden.",
      "output_sha256": "9248f74c94473e9bce9892722e8870c2e3841101bdcadbe6e276fae2ea9ac888",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "9248f74c94473e9bce9892722e8870c2e3841101bdcadbe6e276fae2ea9ac888",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "There, I was greeted by rows of potatoes, some drying in the open air while others were neatly packed in sacks.",
      "output_sha256": "40e1addd71d498c9857ea0090db0de9cdfac66b77df17ae6e8e27037bcd31388",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.449634,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a0e7808d61d63e6c6a2e84e169b91854ac0d414688edc882800bf225aa508ffd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_ai_sha256": "40e1addd71d498c9857ea0090db0de9cdfac66b77df17ae6e8e27037bcd31388",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Alongside them were marrows, beans, cabbages, and lettuces.",
      "output_sha256": "02d8158ee4e0f71b1a78b4b2e1f143b98441bfd7cb2ee9c334bb32f3647f557d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.642484,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7580d36f42a856d206ad3d47f0ac545ba3afdb376e9b69321d467d0e42ef9e60"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_ai_sha256": "02d8158ee4e0f71b1a78b4b2e1f143b98441bfd7cb2ee9c334bb32f3647f557d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A little apologetically, he offered me some of the largest potatoes—\"just as a hobby,\" he said, meaning thereby that it was only a trifle he offered.",
      "output_sha256": "2cbf522c42371e636b5ff5fde737400812e74c87ca3c48fb569752f977548c71",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "2cbf522c42371e636b5ff5fde737400812e74c87ca3c48fb569752f977548c71",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "As I departed into the twilight, my arms laden with potatoes, I encountered the landlord of the Blue Boar, his shirt sleeves rolled up as usual, showcasing his strong, tanned arms.",
      "output_sha256": "1dd738b8b0e77c26849d59827badbba03d414f579770fdbed613eba037b55be8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": 0.630265,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7234ba2b715acbc388826acbac17223e242a8befbfa9280f0cbf4ce900070414"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1dd738b8b0e77c26849d59827badbba03d414f579770fdbed613eba037b55be8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Bad news that about Mrs. Lummis,\" he said, looking towards the cottage on the other side of the road.",
      "output_sha256": "c7ce1c32213ba43a136402a27b58b79a4d865385e9d2f983f887b2479779e708",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "c7ce1c32213ba43a136402a27b58b79a4d865385e9d2f983f887b2479779e708",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"What is that?\" said I. \"Her son?\"",
      "output_sha256": "ee4d35a5c0a7f2be2bcb588f430fc8a69ba0254a0c324c6ac37b8dcb321ce8ae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "ee4d35a5c0a7f2be2bcb588f430fc8a69ba0254a0c324c6ac37b8dcb321ce8ae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There had been no news of him for two months.",
      "output_sha256": "a9e04b22d8492302a440ca7f385f2b320c98a0a293807ccd41b068c46d323680",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "a9e04b22d8492302a440ca7f385f2b320c98a0a293807ccd41b068c46d323680",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Yes, poor Jack.",
      "output_sha256": "add4caeea446baaf2976c60f58605dd2ea58569c32bc17f4525f8b3b4434ffa1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "add4caeea446baaf2976c60f58605dd2ea58569c32bc17f4525f8b3b4434ffa1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "She received word that he was killed near La Bassée in June.",
      "output_sha256": "b4b504d4802526739cab7e08b5b43e1482ad8d2c41d0ceaf21e39e0d5e4b33f7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": 0.7,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2a1966f9f09ef15d2ec5fa6a713b3b77b74eb916512e6268a61f2fa3579680da"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b4b504d4802526739cab7e08b5b43e1482ad8d2c41d0ceaf21e39e0d5e4b33f7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        68
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Nice feller—and her only son.\"",
      "output_sha256": "abd7638c28a11702fb2f998336773c123aa766ee661ce0f81a82bf3031a633f7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "abd7638c28a11702fb2f998336773c123aa766ee661ce0f81a82bf3031a633f7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Then, more cheerfully, he added, \"Jim's coming home to-morrow.",
      "output_sha256": "d25c942c16a2ec9db64cc869c284f7ef2b5e7a2b3d4e09a25a10acedd3bde7d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "d25c942c16a2ec9db64cc869c284f7ef2b5e7a2b3d4e09a25a10acedd3bde7d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He’s going to get his officer’s uniform sorted out and take a break—the first one he’s had since he left a year ago.”",
